slipwai-extension-unslop

`skill/` is unslop, by Damir Sokolovsky (https://x.com/heydamir, https://heydamir.design/unslop), from
https://github.com/heydamir/unslop at the commit named in `UPSTREAM`. It is licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0), whose full text is in `LICENSE-unslop` and at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. No warranty is given; see section 5 of that licence.

`skill/` is the upstream `skills/unslop` directory, unmodified. What `./init --extension unslop` installs from
it is adapted in three ways, all in `init.py`:

1. `SKILL.md` gains one front-matter line, `capabilities: frontend`, so the project reports the skill when it
   no longer has a browser app.
2. The five pictures under `references/refs/` are installed at `tools/unslop/refs/` instead, because a
   project's skill projection copies a skill as text.
3. The Markdown links to those pictures point at `tools/unslop/refs/`.

The credit in `SKILL.md`, and the credit the skill puts on every story video, are kept as written.

The rest of this package (`init.py`, `hooks/`, `tests/`, the manifest and the documentation) is ROBCOATVG's.
